---
title: Employee reports an incident (POST /api/incidents)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor E as Employee (React app)
    participant C as IncidentController
    participant S as IncidentService
    participant D as DuplicateService /<br/>TokenSimilarityDuplicateDetector
    participant P as DependencyAwarePriorityCalculator<br/>(decorator)
    participant W as WeightedPriorityCalculator
    participant I as Incident (domain)
    participant A as AssignmentStrategy<br/>(SkillBased / LoadBased)
    participant R as IncidentRepository
    participant EP as IncidentEventPublisher
    participant L1 as InAppNotificationListener
    participant L2 as EmailNotificationListener
    participant L3 as LiveUpdateListener
    participant SSE as LiveUpdateRegistry (SSE)

    E->>C: POST /api/incidents (JWT, CreateIncidentRequest)
    C->>S: report(request, actorId from token)
    Note over S: @Transactional starts
    S->>I: new Incident(...) status NEW, audit CREATED
    S->>D: find(IncidentText, actor)
    D-->>S: possible duplicates (hint only, never blocks)
    S->>P: calculate(impact, urgency, service)
    P->>W: calculate(impact, urgency, service)
    W-->>P: base priority
    P->>P: ServiceImpactAnalyzer: >= 3 dependents? raise one level
    P-->>S: priority
    S->>I: classify(priority) -> CLASSIFIED
    S->>I: startSla(SLAPolicy) sets responseDueAt, resolutionDueAt
    opt priority was raised / services impacted
        S->>I: recordSystemEvent(PRIORITY_RAISED, SERVICE_IMPACT)
    end
    S->>A: selectTechnician(incident, available technicians)
    A-->>S: Optional<Technician>
    opt a technician was chosen
        S->>I: assignTo(tech) -> ASSIGNED, tech.activeIncidents + 1
    end
    S->>R: save(incident)
    S->>EP: publishNewEvents(incident, 0)
    loop one IncidentEvent per new audit record
        EP->>L1: onIncidentEvent
        L1->>L1: save Notification rows (NotificationRules)
        EP->>L2: onIncidentEvent
        L2->>L2: log [EMAIL] lines
        EP->>L3: onIncidentEvent
        L3->>L3: build payload, register afterCommit
    end
    S-->>C: IncidentResponse + possibleDuplicates
    Note over S: transaction commits
    L3->>SSE: afterCommit: send "incident" and "notification" events
    SSE-->>E: Server-Sent Events to reporter, technician, admins
    C-->>E: 201 Created (JSON)
